            </note>
            <note corresp="#d774-f3" n="3" xml:id="d774-f3-content">
                <p>The words in brackets have been supplied from telegram <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Sgs</hi> 634 (Department of the Army Files) to
                    clarify an omission at this point in the message here printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d774-f4" n="4" xml:id="d774-f4-content">
                <p>William H. B. Mack.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
